A finishing uppercut that deals [141%, 154%, 164%, 172%, 180% (TL1-5)] damage, and attempts to stun your target for [3, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] to [4, 5, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns, depending on the amount of combo points you've accumulated.

The stun chance will improve with your Physical Power.

Using this talent removes your combo points.
